<title>USA: Comsat OKs tax free spinoff of Ascent.</title>
<headline>Comsat OKs tax free spinoff of Ascent.</headline>
<dateline>BATHESDA, Md. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COMSAT Corp said Friday that it approved a plan to distribute its 80.67 percent stake in Ascent Entertainment Group Inc to its shareholders through a tax-free dividend.</p>
<p>The company said it received a ruling from the Internal Revenue Service saying a spinoff would not be taxable to the corporation or its shareholders.</p>
